# Claude Code local project memory (machine-specific)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Vale style packages (downloadable, not source — the vocabulary stays tracked).
# `styles/*` rather than `styles/`: git cannot re-include a path whose parent
# directory is itself excluded, so the negation below would never fire.
styles/*
!styles/config/
